{"version":1,"key":"card:608","content":{"id":608,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"131f9996-04de-444f-8d56-12339fce544b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"TypeScript 中的枚举可以在运行时计算确定，因此其值不是在编译时而是在运行时才确定的，不妨称这种枚举为延迟枚举"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"e187486b-a61a-4826-a289-1faa8a5e54ae","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1f1b7dde-fd89-4d33-8db7-6219329aef36","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const lazyValue = () => 100 + 100;\n\nenum Value {\n  A,\n  B = lazyValue()\n}","collabId":"bf86c5a0-f8a0-4824-9af6-b08dd5009a1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2a8ff5ea-b74c-412b-9188-f37a3294e939","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的代码被编译为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"32d77e38-1700-4eb1-9360-474488c784e2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"4a632de8-2e32-4be9-8dee-6231c7e42dcc","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const lazyValue = () => 100 + 100;\nvar Value;\n(function (Value) {\n    Value[Value[\"A\"] = 0] = \"A\";\n    Value[Value[\"B\"] = lazyValue()] = \"B\";\n})(Value || (Value = {}));","collabId":"a1030ee5-49ee-48f2-bb16-79a1ac580cb0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2e248d1c-4ca8-41d0-a213-1b9ff408ca7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由此可见，因为无法在编译时确定其值，位于其后的未初始化值必须在一个显示初始化的值后面"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"8693f0cf-fe25-4786-a359-a71f169505a4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3e6dcc67-a6af-4c5b-9edd-3f75fa3c57c4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const lazyValue = () => 100 + 100;\n\nenum Value {\n  A,\n  B = lazyValue(),\n  // ❌，C 的值无法确定\n  // Enum member must have initializer.\n  C\n}","collabId":"20771002-6fb2-45c8-8638-1a6a177630d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"e7b86401-d9bf-4498-b4af-ee63f59868b3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0ce0bd8e-3310-4bbb-9b35-790bb5f3e268","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const lazyValue = () => 100 + 100;\n\nenum Value {\n  A,\n  B = lazyValue(),\n  C = 2,\n  // ✅ D 的值可以在编译时计算出来，D = C + 1 = 3\n  D\n}","collabId":"c50de044-c06b-4418-97d9-36de4a745dcb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"71e49b4b-97cf-4824-94f9-f32c3660645c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外还有一个注意项就是延迟枚举无法和"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":1613,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":609,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"a255b223-8bda-4ca1-b52c-d886de6506cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常量枚举"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"共存，因为常量枚举在编译时会被替换为具体的值，而延迟枚举无法在编译时确定，因此二者是无法共存的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"de4a97c6-6209-4c88-8ee6-d1230f8e000a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0fc51dad-7d83-4672-8c34-4bd933104a9f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d99